<title>USA: Daniels Cty SD 1, Mont. won by Citizens Bank.</title>
<headline>Daniels Cty SD 1, Mont. won by Citizens Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citizens Bank, Scobey said it won $1.750 million of Daniels Cty K-12 School District No. 1, Mont., general obligation school bonds building bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.24 percent.  </p>
<p>Details of the offering's winning scale were delayed in release because bad weather has delayed the financial adviser.</p>
<p>Details will be released on Thursday.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
